  "name": "tulip",
  "description": "Tulip is a high-concurrency, open-source team collaboration server implementing a unique topic-based threading model to facilitate organized asynchronous communication. It leverages a Python/Django backend with a Tornado-powered real-time event system and a sophisticated TypeScript frontend to provide an enterprise-grade messaging experience. The project encompasses comprehensive modules for multi-tenant administration, automated billing via Stripe, and an extensible integration framework.",
